  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Temperature Converter</h1>\n    <form id=\"converter\" novalidate>\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"convert\">Convert</button>\n    </form>\n    <p class=\"result-line\">Result: <output id=\"result\">--</output></p>\n    <p class=\"formula\">Formulas: C→F: x × 9/5 + 32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F→C: (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2e2b4a;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --border: #5a4b8a;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg) repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #22243a 0 4px, transparent 4px 8px);\n  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f0f1a;\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: min(100%, 420px);\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\nh1 {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\nform { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }\nlabel { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 8px; }\ninput, select, button {\n  font: inherit;\n  padding: 10px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  background: #1f1d33;\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\nbutton {\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #1a1c2c;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;\n}\nbutton:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(4px, 4px); box-shadow: none; }\n.result-line {\n  margin: 20px 0 0;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n#result {\n  color: var(--accent);\n  background: #1f1d33;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border: 2px solid var(--border);\n}\n.formula {\n  margin: 16px 0 0;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 20px; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const temperatureInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst directionSelect = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertButton = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convertTemperature() {\n  const raw = temperatureInput.value.trim();\n  const value = parseFloat(raw);\n  if (raw === '' || !isFinite(value)) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  let result;\n  if (directionSelect.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    result = value * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    result = (value - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n  resultOutput.textContent = result.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertButton.addEventListener('click', convertTemperature);\ntemperatureInput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    convertTemperature();\n  }\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA self-contained, offline temperature converter with a pixel-art aesthetic.\n\n## Usage\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature in the text field (ID: `temperature`).\n3. Choose the conversion direction (ID: `direction`):\n   - `c-to-f`: Celsius to Fahrenheit\n   - `f-to-c`: Fahrenheit to Celsius\n4. Click the **Convert** button (ID: `convert`) or press Enter.\n5. The result appears in the output element (ID: `result`) with exactly two decimal places.\n\n## Formulas\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Error Handling\n- Empty input or non-numeric/non-finite values display `Error`.\n- The result initially shows `--`.\n\n## Notes\n- No external assets, packages, or network requests.\n- All paths are relative; works entirely offline.\n- Total lines across HTML/CSS/JS are under 200.\n- Keyboard accessible: all controls are labeled, focusable, and the button can be triggered with Enter.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
